*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.jar  binary
*.war  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
